# netplay: packets sent from a VDP socket are flagged (kViaVdp in the prefix's version byte); a plain UDP socket that
# receives one gets the game data only (VDP's 16-bit length dropped, voice data cut). 007 multiplayer answers System
# Link "getinfo" (from a UDP socket, port 1001) from its VDP socket (1000): the join list ignored the "01 40 FF FF FF FF
# infoResponse" answers. After 0020 and 0024.
diff --git a/src/system/xsocket.cpp b/src/system/xsocket.cpp
index 27ddc1b..cef337b 100644
